#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:2
msgid "Training and Deploying COMPASS Policies with NuRec Assets"
msgstr "使用 NuRec 资产训练和部署 COMPASS 策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:4
msgid ""
"`COMPASS <https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.16372>`_ (Cross-embodiment Mobility "
"Policy via Residual RL and Skill Synthesis) trains navigation policies that "
"can transfer across robot embodiments. Isaac Lab supports COMPASS training "
"with NuRec scene assets, so policies can be developed in reconstructed real-"
"world environments instead of relying only on hand-authored simulation "
"scenes."
msgstr ""
"`COMPASS <https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.16372>`_ （Cross-embodiment Mobility "
"Policy via Residual RL and Skill "
"Synthesis，通过残差强化学习与技能合成实现跨机器人形态的移动策略）用于训练可迁移到不同机器人形态的导航策略。Isaac Lab 支持使用 "
"NuRec 场景资产训练 COMPASS，让策略能够在重建的真实环境中开发，而不必仅依赖手工创建的仿真场景。"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:9
msgid ""
"This page gives a short overview of the supported NuRec assets and example "
"COMPASS training clips. For installation, asset registration, training, "
"evaluation, export, and ROS 2 deployment instructions, see the `COMPASS "
"handbook "
"<https://github.com/NVlabs/COMPASS/blob/real2sim/isaaclab_3.0/docs/handbook/workflows/nurec_real2sim.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"本页简要介绍支持的 NuRec 资产，并展示 COMPASS 训练视频示例。安装、资产注册、训练、评估、导出及 ROS 2 部署步骤，见 "
"`COMPASS 手册 "
"<https://github.com/NVlabs/COMPASS/blob/real2sim/isaaclab_3.0/docs/handbook/workflows/nurec_real2sim.md>`_"
" 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:14
msgid "NuRec Assets for COMPASS"
msgstr "用于 COMPASS 的 NuRec 资产"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:16
msgid ""
"NuRec assets matter for COMPASS because they allow navigation policies to "
"train in simulation on realistic geometry, visual appearance, and obstacle "
"layouts. This, in turn, should reduce the sim-to-real gap between training "
"scenes and real operating environments and improve zero-shot transfer. They "
"also make it possible to evaluate policies in reconstructed simulation "
"scenes that better reflect target deployment spaces."
msgstr ""
"NuRec 资产让 COMPASS "
"导航策略能在仿真中使用逼真的几何结构、视觉外观和障碍物布局进行训练。这有望缩小训练场景与实际运行环境之间的仿真到现实差距，改善零样本迁移效果。它们也支持在重建的仿真场景中评估策略，更贴近目标部署空间。"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:21
msgid ""
"Some sample assets compatible with COMPASS training are available in the "
"`PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec dataset on Hugging Face "
"<https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Hugging Face 上的 PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec 数据集 "
"<https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec>`_ 提供了一些兼容"
" COMPASS 训练的示例资产。"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:25
msgid "Real2Sim Assets"
msgstr "Real2Sim 资产"

#: source/policy_deployment/03_compass_with_NuRec/compass_navigation_policy_with_NuRec.rst:27
msgid ""
"`NVIDIA Neural Reconstruction (NuRec) "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/nurec/index.html>`_ converts real-world sensor data"
" into digital simulation-ready assets for training and testing Physical AI "
"agents. The Real2Sim workflow converts stereo RGB captures into Isaac Sim-"
"ready assets with aligned geometry, collision meshes, and simulation-ready "
"scene augmentation. The PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec dataset includes several "
"robotics scenes produced with this workflow; two examples are shown below."
msgstr ""
"`NVIDIA 神经重建（NuRec） <https://docs.nvidia.com/nurec/index.html>`_ "
"将真实传感器数据转换为可用于仿真的数字资产，用于训练和测试物理 AI 智能体。Real2Sim 工作流将双目 RGB 采集数据转换为 Isaac Sim"
" 可用的资产，包含已对齐的几何体、碰撞网格，以及可直接用于仿真的场景增强内容。PhysicalAI-Robotics-NuRec "
"数据集包含多个通过该流程生成的机器人场景，下面展示其中两个。"

